11. SOURCING PHILOSOPHY

The best Founder Scout source is NOT necessarily the most prestigious institution.

Source quality means:

How likely is this source to reveal an exceptional builder before they are obvious to the broader venture market?

Therefore:

TreeHacks
can be higher signal than
a major university accelerator

Web Development at Berkeley
can be higher signal than
SkyDeck

PennApps
can be higher signal than
a generic entrepreneurship mixer

This is not a judgment about organizational quality.

It is specifically about sourcing alpha.

